@startuml
' claim: kyr-build is one package every repository pins; nothing in it is copied into a repository
package "kyr-build (/usr/local/share/kyr-build or build/sysroot/share/kyr-build)" {
  [gcc_build_profiles.sh] as catalog
  [check_hardening.sh] as gate
  [deps.sh] as deps
  [vendor.sh] as vendor
  [lib/deb.sh] as deblib
  [lib/build.sh] as buildlib
  [buildinfo.sh] as buildinfo
  [build_root.sh] as root
  [lib/root.sh] as rootlib
  [tiers.txt] as tiers
  [lib/tier.sh] as tierlib
  [template/] as template
}
package "a repository" {
  [utils/deps.sh (wrapper)] as wdeps
  [utils/gcc_build_profiles.sh (wrapper)] as wcat
  [utils/check_hardening.sh (wrapper)] as wgate
  [utils/build_deb.sh] as bdeb
  [utils/<name>_project.sh] as project
  [deps.txt] as depstxt
}
wdeps --> deps : bootstraps by version + sha256, then exec
wcat --> catalog : source
wgate --> gate : exec
bdeb --> deblib : source
bdeb --> buildlib : source
deblib --> buildinfo : one .buildinfo per deb
deps --> tierlib : check --tiers: the declaration and every pin's X-Kyr-Tier
deps --> tiers : cross-check (fixed repositories only)
deblib --> tierlib : X-Kyr-Tier in every control file
deps --> vendor : verify
depstxt --> wdeps : own kyr-build <ver> <repo> <sha256>
depstxt --> tierlib : # tier: <n> <kind>
project --> catalog : gcc_build_add / drop / replace
template ..> "a repository" : layout and wrappers (template_check.sh refuses drift)
root ..> rootlib : /etc/kyr-build-root (identity)
buildinfo --> rootlib : Build-Root
deblib --> rootlib : no release outside the root
gate --> rootlib : symbol-version ceilings
@enduml
